		{"id":"0a14b11113871a7c","type":"text","text":"and although her purpose is to bring hapiness to Dan, she felt empty","x":-1580,"y":164,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"878cd2beef53132c","type":"text","text":"She braves herself and approaches the boy, but her shyness got the better of her, and she ran away.","x":-1260,"y":-56,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"40f232c06a8e1f4b","type":"text","text":"Since then, the boy became interested in her drawing skills, and as they got closer together, other friends also got closer.","x":-1260,"y":104,"width":250,"height":185,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"11c4122ff23fc5ea","type":"text","text":"Until one day, he met Ashley, who wants to be his friend","x":-1920,"y":-236,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c93ee9e97bb85cac","type":"text","text":"Everyday, she toils in the abyss","x":-1580,"y":-336,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"9d2082be3a0fb465","type":"text","text":"Until one day, a boy will her into existance","x":-1580,"y":-246,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b1603907b98bedc8","type":"text","text":"Because of that, she befriends the boy","x":-1580,"y":-156,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b2437ddda8e1e957","type":"text","text":"Everyday, she escape to the school's backyard to draw the scenery","x":-1260,"y":-336,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"6d3278a430006eee","type":"text","text":"Until one day, when she is helping a teacher out, she read a passage from a student called Daniel Brown","x":-1260,"y":-216,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"1"},
