		{"id":"06c3a677b6f568ef","type":"text","text":"Dan n Margie relationship\n\n1. Dan met Margie\n2. \n3. \n4. \n5. They got closer\n6. But Margie asked why he is distant\n7. \n8. \n","x":-980,"y":-502,"width":270,"height":308},
		{"id":"7dde8c9633d3d74b","type":"text","text":"Dan's Character Arc","x":-1920,"y":-516,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"00cb89645a8d481a","type":"text","text":"Once upon a time, there is a lonely boy","x":-1920,"y":-416,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d7ffaf22088e5782","type":"text","text":"Because of that, he had an only friend. ","x":-1920,"y":-96,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ce2b280ac7227b83","type":"text","text":"He somewhat grows more social with her, ","x":-1920,"y":24,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"69b1aee1e4423744","type":"text","text":"Until finally, he got reminded that Ashley isn't real. ","x":-1920,"y":144,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"acea477203f7142c","type":"text","text":"Everyday, where his friends plays, he only plays alone","x":-1920,"y":-336,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"8fa93c18c42fa69e","type":"text","text":"Until he met a girl called Margie, who said that she liked his writing and imagination, she drew one of his fantasy machines.","x":-1920,"y":513,"width":250,"height":171,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"7485dfd7775311ef","type":"text","text":"Because of that, he grew closer with Margie, he approaches her more, just like how Ashley did.","x":-1920,"y":704,"width":250,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"5416c6351c3889a0","type":"text","text":"Until eventually, she told him the truth. that she did not exist. because she said it, then Dan must recognise this too. Everything she spoke, he spoke too, everything she thinks, he thinks too. \"I am you.\"","x":-1580,"y":432,"width":250,"height":242,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"276988162609c5f8","type":"text","text":"Because of that, she talks to him less and less.","x":-1580,"y":704,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"6c8499422f280999","type":"text","text":"Until eventually, she realise that he made friends.","x":-1580,"y":804,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b73869f166e60611","type":"text","text":"Until eventually, Dan revealed that he had an imaginary friend once, and said that she'd be proud of him.","x":-1920,"y":844,"width":250,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bc06787eea7535d9","type":"text","text":"Until eventually, he met his frist love","x":-1580,"y":924,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"3d5c12e6b3385073","type":"text","text":"Because of that, They became close friends, a Writer and an Artist.","x":-1920,"y":1044,"width":250,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a7ce0b4e5dded2e1","type":"text","text":"Until eventually, Ashley felt her brief existence has made its purpose.","x":-1580,"y":1044,"width":250,"height":80,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ebb3e80624cb75c3","type":"text","text":"Until finally, they become romantic partners. Ashley watches from behind a tree, giving thumbs up.","x":-1920,"y":1184,"width":250,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"1483d3e9827b7c6b","type":"text","text":"Close friendship grows into lovers.","x":-1260,"y":549,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"a0797542175dab73","type":"text","text":"Until finally, he recognises that Ashley isn't real.","x":-1920,"y":264,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bd903ea53601ad30","type":"text","text":"Since then, he feels alone","x":-1920,"y":389,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a311cbd45fdf8a11","type":"text","text":"And as Dan distances himself from his friends more and more, she began to feel bad for him","x":-1580,"y":289,"width":250,"height":115,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"96282613521daed3","type":"text","text":"She then had a lot of friends and close-knit group.","x":-1260,"y":304,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"627a8cfd588752bd","type":"text","text":"Her friendship with Dan grows into close friendship","x":-1260,"y":432,"width":250,"height":100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"c0ba2a9278f64ca3","type":"text","text":"Ashley asked him for his first adventure, Dan was skeptical at first, since Ashley is a girl.","x":-130,"y":-40,"width":490,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"e258f0aba3eaf847","type":"text","text":"Dan trusts Ashley more, and since then they always goes on adventures together after school.","x":-130,"y":60,"width":490,"height":60,"color":"6"},
